    We next rule out the boundary $\chi_l^\ast=-1$. Since~(equation eq:informative of the paper) holds, Perron-Frobenius applied to the irreducible nonnegative matrix $\Diag(\sqrt\lambda)(B\odot B)\Diag(\sqrt\lambda)$ gives a nonnegative direction along which the ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7f29c86461ddf1d0e8dad845ae1030e00f3fb95662cbbdd52ccffaba49f2eb41","revision_digest":"sha256:5ff4d1a393a6f6c86adbbd77b7f1e5961f80e810f0c2308f3ab0f70ba95a0634","source_id":"arxiv:2605.19894","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

