[Lemma lem:multiplication-formula of arXiv:2411.07680, 'Energy solutions of singular SPDEs on Hilbert spaces with applications to domains with bou'] Let $\delta$ be the Skorokhod integral and
  let $D$ be the Malliavin derivative, both with respect to the white noise on
  $H$. Let $F \in \mathcal{C}$ and let $\varphi \in \ensuremath{\operatorname{dom}} (\delta)$. Then
  \begin{equation}
    F \delta (\varphi) = \delta (F \varphi) + \langle D F, \varphi \rangle_H .

  \end{equation}
  In particular, we have for any $h \in H$
  \begin{equation}
    F (\eta) \eta (h) = \delta (F h) (\eta) + \langle D F (\eta), h \rangle_H
    = \delta (F h) (\eta) + D_h F (\eta) . 
  \end{equation}

