body:
[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2606.24485, 'On the convex hull of a planar Brownian bridge with a random Gaussian endpoint'] For every $\sigma \in [0,1]$, one has
	\begin{equation}
		\int_0^1 t(1-t)\arctan\ob{\sigma\sqrt{\frac{1-t}{t}}}\D t
		=
		\frac{\pi\sigma(4\sigma^2+9\sigma+3)}{48(1+\sigma)^3}.
	\end{equation}

