[Def steel-condition of arXiv:2608.26876, 'Local Bousfield classes via homological support'] We say that $\cat T$ satisfies the \emph{steel condition} when the canonical map
	\begin{equation}
		\pi\colon\Spc^h(\cat T^c)\to \Spc(\cat T^c)
	\end{equation}
	is a bijection. It is always surjective by [Balmer20_nilpotence].

