body:
[Lemma no-eigenvalue outside support of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] For a compact set $S\subset\RR$, write
    \[
        S^{(\delta)}:=\cbr{x\in\RR:\mathrm{dist}(x,S)\le\delta}
    \]
    for its closed $\delta$-neighborhood.
    For any $\delta,D>0$, we have
    \begin{equation}
        \PP\sbr{ \mathsf{spec}\rbr{H_1+ \Gamma \otimes I_n} \subseteq \supp(\mu_{\Gamma})^{(\delta)} } \ge 1-n^{-D}
    \end{equation}
    for all sufficiently large $n$.

