[Corollary 32 of arXiv:2609.03248, 'Connections between colored restricted $b$-ary and ordinary partitions'] For any integers $b\geq 2$ and $n\geq 1$, we have
\begin{equation}
\overline{C}_b^2(bn)-2\overline{C}_b^2(bn-2)+\overline{C}_b^2(bn-4)
=\overline{C}_b^2(n),
\end{equation}
and for $b\geq 3$,
\begin{equation}
\overline{C}_b^2(bn-1)-2\overline{C}_b^2(bn-3)+\overline{C}_b^2(bn-5) = 0.
\end{equation}
In both identities we assume that $\overline{C}_b^2(m)=0$ when $m<0$.

