for every $\ell \ge 2$  and $T>0$
there exists a constant $C>0$,
only depending on $\alpha,\beta,\gamma, \delta, \sigma, \ell,T$,
such that
\begin{multline*}
\|\Psi_{\gamma, \varepsilon}(X^x_\varepsilon)\|_{
L^{\ell}(\Omega; L^\infty(0,T; L^1(\mathcal O))} + 
\|\Psi_{\gamma, \varepsilon}'(X^x_\varepsilon)
\Psi_{\beta, \varepsilon}'(X^x_\varepsilon)\|_{
