of bounded variation), then
\begin{align*}
\mathbb{P}_{x}\left( \underline{U}_{\infty }>r,\tau _{0}^{-}<\infty  \right)  =&
W\left( 0\right) \mathbb{E}\left[ X_{1}\right]\frac{1-W(x)(\mathbb{E}[X_1]-\Upsilon \left( r\right)) -\Lambda \left( x,r\right) }{1-W(0)( \Upsilon \left( r\right)-\mathbb{E}[X_1]) }.
