body:
[Defn 2 of arXiv:2506.11770, 'Convergence to equilibrium for a class of exchange economies'] The {\em total variation distance} between two probability measures $\mu,\nu$ on a measure space $\calM$ is
\begin{equation}
d_{TV}(\mu,\nu) = \sup_{A} \mu(A)-\nu(A)
\end{equation}
over measurable subsets $A$ of $\calM$.

