[Proposition 24 of arXiv:2607.11756, 'Full replica symmetry breaking in the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model'] Let \(q_\beta\) be as in \Cref{prop:connected-support}. Then
\begin{equation}
    \mu_\beta(\{q_\beta\})>0.
