body:
[Lemma Generator Bounds of arXiv:2507.12502, 'Quantitative Edge Eigenvector Universality for Random Regular Graphs: Berry-Esseen Bounds '] The generator of the backward process applied to $V$ satisfies:
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{L}^{\text{back}} V(\mathbf{x}) = 2\sum_i x_i \tilde{b}_i + \sum_{i,j} a_{ij} \leq -2V(\mathbf{x}) + K + \mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x})
\end{equation}
where $|\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x})| \leq C_3 K^2 N^{-1/6+\varepsilon}(1 + V(\mathbf{x}))$.

