[Lemma lem:volQ+u^2 of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] Let $Q$ be a positive definite quadratic form on $V$ and let $u\in V^*$. Then, for every $Q'$ positive definite quadratic form on $V$, we have 
  \begin{equation}
    \vol_{Q'}((B_{(Q+u^2)})^\circ)=\sqrt{1+Q^\circ(u)}\vol_{Q'}(B_{Q}^\circ).
  \end{equation}

