		&\quad\times\bigg(\frac{1}{\beta_1}+\frac{1}{\beta_2}\bigg)^{1-\alpha_1-\alpha_2-k}U\bigg(1-a_{j,k}(x),2-\alpha_1-\alpha_2-k,\bigg(\frac{1}{\beta_1}+\frac{1}{\beta_2}\bigg)|x|\bigg), 
