		\hat{\mathfrak{P}}^{(n)} (t, B_1 \times B_2\times B_3) = \int_0^t \sum_{i = 1}^2 \mathbbm{1}_{i \in B_1}\int_{ B_2} \int_{B_3} Y^{n}_{s-}(x) dx \nu_n^i(d\lambda)ds,
