[Lemma 60 of arXiv:2604.04267, 'On Sharpest Tail Bounds for Functions \\ of Tail Bounded Random Variables'] Let $V \subset \mathbb{R}^n$ be closed. For $G^k \subset \mathbb{R}$ denote $H^k = \big(G^k \cap \overline{\pi_k(V)} \big) \cup \{0\}$ and define 
\begin{equation} 
\psi(G^k) = H^k \cup \Big(\Big[\big(\overline{H^k_{|\cdot|}} \backslash H^k_{|\cdot|}\big) \cup \big(\overline{H^k_{|\cdot|}} \backslash H^k_{|\cdot|} \big)_- \Big] \cap \overline{\pi_k(V)}\Big).
\end{equation} 
Then $\psi(G^k)_{|\cdot|} = \overline{H^k_{|\cdot|}}$.

