[Theorem 20 (Wiener chaos decomposition) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] The Hilbert space $\cH$ can be decomposed into the infinite orthogonal sum 
of the subspaces $\cH_n$:
\begin{equation}
 \cH = \bigoplus_{n=0}^\infty \cH_n\;.
\end{equation}

