[Corollary 7 (Supercritical cutoff for $X^{(N)}$) of arXiv:2608.15914, 'Absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical syste'] Under the assumptions of \cref{thm:gaussian-process-cutoff}, $X^{(N)}$ has
