    Since $\rho >1$ we have the embedding $H^{-\rho}_{\operatorname{div}}\hookrightarrow H^{-\rho}_g$, we have, by BDG 
    \begin{align*}
        \expt[]{\|\mathcal{M}^n_t-\mathcal{M}^n_s\|_{ H^{-\rho}_g}^{2q}} &\lesssim \expt[]{\Big(\sum_{k\in I}\int_s^t\|\mathcal{L}_{\sigma^n_k}\omega^n_r\|_{ H^{-\rho}}^{2}\mathrm{d}r\Big)^q} \\
