body:
[Lemma 118 of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] Let $A,B \subset V$ and suppose that $v \not\in A \cup B$. Then
    \begin{equation} 
    Q_v(\tau_A < \tau_B) \leq \frac{\effR{}{v}{A \cup B}}{\effR{}{v}{A}} \leq \frac{\effR{}{v}{B}}{\effR{}{v}{A}}.
\end{equation}

