[Prop 15 of arXiv:2608.11695, 'Generalised stochastic curvature flow in $d \geq 2$, and sharp interface limit for the sto'] Let $\rho_\eps^\pm$ be the solution to \eqref{eq:PDE_approximate_rho} specified in Theorem~\ref{thm:well_posedness_smcf}. Then we have
    \begin{equation} 
    \left| \d_t\rho_\eps^\pm + \frac1\eps \mathfrak{c}(\nabla\rho_\eps^\pm, \eps \nabla^2 \rho_\eps^\pm, \eps\xi_\eps\pm \eps^\beta) \right| \lesssim \eps^{-\kappa}|\rho_\eps^\pm|
    \end{equation}
    uniformly on $[0,\tau] \times \oO$.

