[Lemma lem:12 of arXiv:2512.09219, 'Strong confluence of geodesics in Liouville quantum gravity'] Suppose that (equation it:geodstar of the paper) in Lemma (lem:geodesic_between_geodesics of the paper) holds. We then have the following:
  \begin{enumerate}
