[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2608.28964, '2608.28964'] For any $g$ satisfying \eqref{eq g}, the weight $\Theta_g$ defined by \eqref{eq weight} extends by zero to a function in $C^\infty([0,1])$ and satisfies
