[Lemma lemma_X_shift of arXiv:2603.29442, 'A compact support property for infinite-dimensional SDEs with Hölder continuous coefficien'] For all $\zeta>0$ and $\delta>0$, for any $\mathbb{P} \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}$, $k \in \mathbb{N}_0$ and $r \geq 0$,
\begin{equation*}
\mathbb{P}(X_k > r) = \mathbb{P}(\Gamma^k_1< J) \cdot \mathbb{P}_{a_k}(X_k > r)
\end{equation*}
for some $\mathbb{P}_{a_k} \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}(a_k)$.

