[Conjecture of arXiv:2606.11677, 'Feynman--Kac formula for the heat equation with a one-center point interaction in $d=3$.'] Let $\Sigma\subset {\mathbb{R}}^d$ be a compact set which is not a removable set for $\Delta$ in $L^2({\mathbb{R}}^d)$. Then, there exist a self-adjoint extension  of $\Delta|_{C_c^\infty({\mathbb{R}}^d\backslash \Sigma)}$ in $L^2({\mathbb{R}}^d)$, $\widetilde{\Delta}$, and  a measure valued process $\left\{\mathcal{X}_t\right\}_{t\geq 0}$ such that  \begin{align*}
\mathtt{E}_{\delta_x}[\mathcal{X}_t(u_0)]=\widetilde{u}(t,x)
\end{align*}
for any $t>0$ and any $x\in {\mathbb{R}}^3\backslash\Sigma$, where $\widetilde{u}$ is the solution to \begin{align*}
\partial_t u=\frac{1}{2}\widetilde{\Delta}u,\quad u(0,x)=u_0(x).
\end{align*} (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)

[Lem 33 of arXiv:2609.02561, 'NON-NEF LOCI IN MIXED CHARACTERISTIC'] With notation as above, let $S^0 \subset S$ be an open subset with $f(\Gamma)\cap S^0 \neq \emptyset$. Set $X^0 := f^{-1}(S^0)$, $D^0 := D|_{X^0}$, $f^0:=f|_{X^0}$, and ${\Gamma}^{0} := \Gamma \cap X^0$.
Then the following hold.
\begin{enumerate}
\item $ \ord_{\Gamma^{0}}(X^0 / S^0 , \|D^0\|)=\ord_{\Gamma}(X/S,\|D\|)$.
\item $\ord_{\Gamma^{0}}(\|D^0\| , X^0 / S^0)=\ord_{\Gamma}(\|D\|,X/S).$
\end{enumerate}

[Definition 40 of arXiv:2607.18104, '2607.18104'] Let $\hfixp_0 \in \UCp$ and $\Lp$ be a periodic directed landscape on $(\mathbb{T} \times \R)^{2}_{\uparrow}$. Then define the random function $(y,t) \mapsto \hfixp(\hfixp_0;y,t)$ for all $y\in \mathbb{T}$ and $t >0$ by
\begin{equation}
 \hfixp\big(\hfixp_0;y,t\big) := \sup_{x\in \mathbb{T}} \big( \hfixp_0(x) + \Lp(x,0;y,t)\big).
\end{equation}

[Defn 29 of arXiv:2608.28200, '\textbf On the Formality of Configuration Spaces of $\aka$'] Let $U\subset\R^p\times\C^q$ be an open subvariety. The functor  
\ali{
U_{alg} \ni V \lmt \OconU(V) 
} 
defines a sheaf on the site $U_{alg}$. 
This sheaf is called the constructible structure sheaf and is denoted by $\OconU$.

