        \lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} \frac{1}{n^\alpha \br{1-\br{\frac{\lambda}{n}}^{\frac{\delta}{\delta+1}}}} = 1 + \frac{1}{\delta}.
    \end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

