[Lem var of arXiv:2608.25362, 'Fluctuations of the free energy of the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model with ferromagnetic i'] For any $\boldsymbol{\beta} \in \mathcal{B}$, $\gamma \geqslant 0$ and $\mu, h \in \mathds{R}$, we have
    \begin{align*}
