[Proposition prop:first-counter-example-2 of arXiv:2604.04882, 'On a Problem of M. Kac on Laplace Distributions'] Fix $0<a<\frac12$. The functions
    \begin{align}
        f_1(\xi)=\frac{2+a\xi^2}{2(1+a\xi^2)},
        \qquad
        f_2(\xi)=\frac{2+a\xi^2}{2+2\xi^2+a\xi^4}
    \end{align}
    are characteristic functions satisfying (equation eq:defining-equation of the paper), but neither is of the form (equation eq:laplace of the paper).

