[Lemma lem:boosted small of arXiv:2606.24465, 'History estimation in random recursive trees:\\Pointwise approach via iterated Jordan cent'] There exists a constant $C>0$ such that for any $v\in [n]$ and for any $t \geq 1$, the random variable $\phi_n^{{\scriptscriptstyle{({2}})}}(v)$ satisfies 
